observed = "The daemon signs only with a bearer token whose subject owns the key or with agent headers, and cmd/attestor configures no agent verifier, so the live deliver has no credential for its test signature and the command tests that drive deliver without a token source answer token_missing."
assumption = "The rehearsal mints owner tokens from its own issuer; the live ceremony needs an owner decision on how the operator obtains a signing credential."
