observed = "The attestor API requires and verifies a client certificate at the TLS handshake for every path, so the https /health platform check could never pass; the five definitions now carry a tcp_check on 8443, closing the health half of observation 1.12.2, while check-deploy's health-check rule still demands an http /health check on every attestor and fails for them."
assumption = "check-deploy learns that an attestor whose API is mutual TLS is checked by tcp on its API port, or the daemon grows a plain health listener that the platform check can reach."
