observed = "The platform init mounted attestor_data at /data with uid and gid 65532, the distroless non-root user, on all five machines, the daemon opened its share store and audit log there and answered ready, and the default policy reached /etc/attestor/policy.json through a local_path file mapping owned by the same user."
assumption = "The volume half of observation 1.12.2 is closed by the platform's own chown for an image with a non-root USER; no definition change was needed for it."
