observed = "Against the hardened daemon the e2e signs in, generates the key under the gateway authority and reaches sign, which every signer refuses: the kernel's asset operation 5 payload is the signed send encoding tagged 0x5301 while the kernel evaluator decodes operation 5 as a 112-byte from, to, asset and amount transfer, and the test agent layer also builds a label authority and a fixed validity window the evaluator checks against the wall clock."
assumption = "The kernel evaluator must decode the kernel's own send payload before any human send can be attestor-signed; the test's owner-key authority and wall-clock window are follow-up edits once that decoder exists."
severity = "blocker"

[observation.4.6.4]
